      {
        "id": "530109",
        "date_added": "2026-11-20 10:34:11",
        "twitter_handle": null,
        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "Decrypted inner payload of the Go reflective loader b8c1d239... (also on MalwareBazaar), original file layout (937,984 B, raw offsets differ from RVAs; not a memory dump). Recovered statically: the loader's six in-place byte passes (rol5, reverse, +29*i+10, half swap, -17*i-0x7a, rol3) over the 1,006,700 B blob in .rdata, run as bare CPU-emulator loops (no OS, no network); the result equals an earlier emulator memory dump with 0 byte differences. x64 C/C++ infostealer: browser, wallet, Telegram, Steam and Discord data theft, a Telegram-channel dead drop that decrypts to a /gate URL, multipart POST exfiltration. Family label is behavioural only (Vidar 2.x-like). Delivered by a fake \"cracked trading software\" promoted on X. Rule and tool: github.com/harperjohnsai/detections (cryptotrice-go-loader). More research: youtube.com/@HarperJohnsAI - Harper Johns\n"
      }
    ],
